-    # §2 CONTRACT GAP (issues #67/#68 verification, ABI v1): this reads
-    # the number from OFF_A0 (user a0) and args from a1-a3, but
-    # src/libc/syscall.h specifies a7=num, a0-a3=args. riscv64 has no
